<?php /** @var array $keys @var array $hooks @var array $deliveries @var array $apiCapabilities @var array $webhookEvents @var string|null $newToken @var string|null $newSecret @var \Core\Security\Csrf $csrf @var string $basePath */ ?>
<?php foreach ([['value'=>$newToken,'title'=>'New API key','help'=>'Only its hash is stored. Copy this credential before leaving the page.'],['value'=>$newSecret,'title'=>'New webhook signing secret','help'=>'Use this to verify the X-WC-Signature HMAC header.']] as $secret): if (!$secret['value']) continue; ?><section class="card secret-card"><div class="card-heading"><div><h2><?= e($secret['title']) ?></h2><p class="card-subtitle"><?= e($secret['help']) ?></p></div><span class="badge warn">Shown once</span></div><div class="copy-field"><input readonly value="<?= e_attr($secret['value']) ?>" aria-label="<?= e_attr($secret['title']) ?>"><button type="button" class="btn secondary" data-copy-previous>Copy</button></div></section><?php endforeach; ?>
<div class="section-grid">
<section class="card"><div class="card-heading"><div><h2>API keys</h2><p class="card-subtitle">Scoped bearer credentials for trusted tools and agency monitoring.</p></div><span class="badge neutral"><?= count($keys) ?> keys</span></div>
<?php if (!$keys): ?><div class="empty-state"><strong>No API keys</strong><span>Create a narrowly scoped key when a trusted integration needs access.</span></div><?php else: ?><table><thead><tr><th>Key</th><th>Scopes</th><th>Activity</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($keys as $key): $caps=json_decode((string)$key['capabilities_json'],true)?:[]; ?><tr><td><strong><?= e($key['label']) ?></strong><br><code><?= e($key['token_prefix']) ?>…</code></td><td><?php foreach($caps as $cap): ?><span class="badge neutral"><?= e($cap) ?></span> <?php endforeach; ?></td><td><?= $key['revoked_at'] ? '<span class="badge bad">Revoked</span>' : e($key['last_used_at'] ?? 'Never used') ?></td><td><?php if(!$key['revoked_at']): ?><form method="post"><?= $csrf->field() ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="key_revoke"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?= (int)$key['id'] ?>"><button class="btn small danger" data-confirm="Revoke this API key? Connected clients will immediately lose access.">Revoke</button></form><?php endif; ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></tbody></table><?php endif; ?>
<details class="disclosure"><summary class="btn secondary">Create API key</summary><form method="post" class="disclosure-body"><?= $csrf->field() ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="key_create"><label>Purpose / label<input name="label" required placeholder="Agency health monitor"></label><fieldset class="option-grid"><legend>Allowed scopes</legend><?php foreach($apiCapabilities as $cap): ?><label class="choice-row compact"><input type="checkbox" name="capabilities[]" value="<?= e_attr($cap) ?>"><span><?= e($cap) ?></span></label><?php endforeach; ?></fieldset><button class="btn">Create key</button></form></details></section>

<section class="card"><div class="card-heading"><div><h2>Webhooks</h2><p class="card-subtitle">Durable HTTPS event delivery signed with HMAC-SHA256.</p></div><span class="badge neutral"><?= count($hooks) ?> endpoints</span></div>
<?php if(!$hooks): ?><div class="empty-state"><strong>No webhook endpoints</strong><span>Add one to notify an external service when important events occur.</span></div><?php else: ?><table><thead><tr><th>Endpoint</th><th>Events</th><th>Status</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($hooks as $hook): ?><tr><td><strong><?= e($hook['label']) ?></strong><br><span class="page-path"><?= e($hook['url']) ?></span></td><td><?= e(implode(', ',json_decode((string)$hook['events_json'],true)?:[])) ?></td><td><span class="badge <?= $hook['active']?'ok':'neutral' ?>"><?= $hook['active']?'Active':'Disabled' ?></span></td><td><form method="post" class="inline-toggle-form" <?= $hook['active']?'data-confirm="Disable this webhook? Pending deliveries will remain visible."':'' ?>><?= $csrf->field() ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="<?= $hook['active']?'webhook_disable':'webhook_enable' ?>"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?= (int)$hook['id'] ?>"><label class="toggle-control compact"><span class="sr-only"><?= $hook['active']?'Disable':'Enable' ?> <?= e($hook['label']) ?></span><input type="checkbox" <?= $hook['active']?'checked':'' ?> data-auto-submit><span class="toggle-track" aria-hidden="true"></span></label></form></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></tbody></table><?php endif; ?>
<details class="disclosure"><summary class="btn secondary">Create webhook</summary><form method="post" class="disclosure-body"><?= $csrf->field() ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="webhook_create"><label>Label<input name="label" required placeholder="CRM notifications"></label><label>Public HTTPS endpoint<input type="url" name="url" required placeholder="https://example.com/hooks/core"></label><fieldset class="option-grid"><legend>Events</legend><?php foreach($webhookEvents as $event): ?><label class="choice-row compact"><input type="checkbox" name="events[]" value="<?= e_attr($event) ?>"><span><?= e($event) ?></span></label><?php endforeach; ?></fieldset><button class="btn">Create webhook</button></form></details></section>
</div>

<section class="card"><div class="card-heading"><div><h2>Portable site transfer</h2><p class="card-subtitle">Move pages and presentation settings without administrator identities, credentials, submissions, or private data.</p></div><a class="btn" href="<?= e_attr($basePath) ?>/admin/integrations/export">Export JSON</a></div><form method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="action-bar" data-busy-label="Importing…"><?= $csrf->field() ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="site_import"><div><strong>Import and merge</strong><p class="field-note">Existing matching content may be updated. Create a backup first.</p></div><input type="file" name="site_file" accept="application/json,.json" required><button class="btn secondary" data-confirm="Import and merge this site file? A backup is recommended first.">Import file</button></form></section>
<section class="card"><div class="card-heading"><div><h2>Recent webhook deliveries</h2><p class="card-subtitle">Failed deliveries can be queued again after the endpoint is repaired.</p></div></div><?php if(!$deliveries): ?><div class="empty-state"><strong>No deliveries yet</strong><span>Subscribed events will appear here after they occur.</span></div><?php else: ?><table><thead><tr><th>Webhook</th><th>Event</th><th>Status</th><th>HTTP</th><th>Attempted</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($deliveries as $delivery): ?><tr><td><?= e($delivery['label']) ?></td><td><code><?= e($delivery['event']) ?></code></td><td><span class="badge <?= $delivery['status']==='delivered'?'ok':($delivery['status']==='failed'?'bad':'warn') ?>"><?= e(ucfirst($delivery['status'])) ?></span><?php if(!empty($delivery['last_error'])): ?><br><small class="text-bad"><?= e($delivery['last_error']) ?></small><?php endif; ?></td><td><?= e($delivery['http_status']??'—') ?></td><td><?= e($delivery['attempted_at']??'Queued') ?></td><td><?php if($delivery['status']==='failed'): ?><form method="post"><?= $csrf->field() ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="webhook_retry"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?= (int)$delivery['id'] ?>"><button class="btn small secondary">Retry</button></form><?php endif; ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></tbody></table><?php endif; ?></section>
